; FARO - field effect sprites, 8x16 mode (one 8x16 sprite = 2 tiles each), GDD 7.2 effects budget 16:
; EMOTE_ALERT (!), EMOTE_CURIOUS (?), EMOTE_SLEEP (Zz) above a 16x16 actor (x + 4, y - 16);
; ITEM = bundle on the ground (destello: SPARKLE drawn on top, blinking 16/16 f); SHADOW = left half of the
; jump shadow (right half = same flipped X); STONE = sling stone (8x8 in the top tile); BAIT = bait on the ground.
; Heart / stomach HUD icons are UI (res/ui.tiles, ui-designer).
; After the 16 field tiles: FIRE_0..2 = camp fire 16x16, 3 frames (12 tiles; loaded only in CAMP).
; 28 tiles. Generated from a script, then this file is the source of truth.

